Legal finance automation failure handling
title end

paragraph start
When an automation fails it stops, keeps the last good result, writes a log line and tells a person. A missed deadline reminder is treated as a failure.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Every automation has one named person who fixes it and one place for its log.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
failure, what stops, what is kept, who is told, how it is fixed
